OL,3,GNEWSARoad worker brothers describe
OL,4,Anear-death moment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road worker has spoken of the moment
OL,7,Fhe and his brother could have been
OL,8,Fkilled by a reportedly stolen car which
OL,9,Fcrashed through a temporary motorway
OL,10,Fbarrier.
OL,12,FThe BMW X5 drove through roadworks at
OL,13,Fjunction 27 of the M25 in Essex late at
OL,14,Fnight on 15 March 2026 - missing the
OL,15,Fcrew members by inches.
OL,17,FA man was arrested close to where the
OL,18,Fcar was found abandoned, but he faced
OL,19,Fno further action due to a lack of
OL,20,Fevidence.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
